/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Claude working files that must never be committed
Claude/.mm_token.json
Claude/soak-report.txt
Claude/gate-report.txt
Claude/gate.db*
Claude/*.jsonl
Claude/phase0_corpus.json
Claude/phase0_findings.json
Claude/__pycache__/
# The build plan: a working copy of an artifact that records this server's
# Phase 0 findings -- its config, its scale, its team names. The canonical copy
# lives outside the repository.
Claude/matterless-plan.html

# Build output
/app/node_modules
/app/dist
/app/src-tauri/gen

# Icon previews: generated by Claude/make_icon.py to be looked at, not kept.
# `icon-source.png` IS kept -- it is what the app's icons are generated from.
Claude/icon-preview-*.png
Claude/icon-sheet.png

# A minted session token is a bearer credential: never committed, wherever it
# is written.
tools/.mm_token.json
# The updater's signing key. Whoever holds the private half can push an update
# to every install, so it never goes near the repository -- only into the
# repository's secrets. The `.pub` half is safe, but is kept out too: the copy
# that matters is the one pasted into tauri.conf.json.
tools/updater.key
tools/updater.key.pub
*.key
.mm_token.json
.gate.db*
